<description>&lt;p&gt;Joseph Kabila now leads a rebel coalition that includes M23, which has seized positions in Rugezi after a week of fighting with Congolese government forces, while the United States has sanctioned Rwanda's defence ministry and its military bank Zigama and is moving to remove Rwanda and South Africa from the AGOA duty-free trade programme. An Ebola outbreak in eastern DR Congo has killed more than 5,300 people and a UK doctor contracted the disease while fighting the outbreak. The Allied Democratic Forces have returned to Lubero, spreading fear, and rescued 29 hostages from ADF extremists. IS-linked militants killed at least 33 civilians in an eastern Congo village attack and ADF attacks killed dozens of civilians in separate incidents. 1,158 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/06/world/europe/europe-migrants-rwanda.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Le Monde.fr&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxQTEc3VWRicmFISXlSQWxkVWhYYWM1ZTBfNk9HMVpNaFV3dlpveDFfRWNFWHBTT1Z5TW1pUF8tLU9OUkNaNmFnMUZ0ajFQaEZjTUpsY21KemJzRlBhTjdGWFlSbEU4QURwMEFFMUVkNlZrM2NtOVNZV0FRV0xlWm4zeXFqbXZoZENiRk9ITlVzNm_SAZYBQVVfeXFMT3QzSDNZNGhnSU5WVG1pdDc4OU42YXNoWGhRYm9Mc1NlcG5ENkttMlBCMnE3UURaaGxqREhxai1lMk5XbVlWRUZYM2MtdS1lUDhTSXJLVW9lUEpnYTZWd0RUUWZDODc0TEw4NEtheE9vMGx1SmNBVG1TTlpLaFctUzBKQ25wemY0NnlmdFNHb2JKWjQ3eVVn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxNVnpEclg3aWRnZjhfYm92MUZSd1ZJWk5Kb0dQWER5Z3hVNFNzdHNHYS1iazFlR2RSSG04QXpZNldTc2NYM2JHMXdQNUkxOGUya0FLdkZiZkYwbFFjX1BhUU9BSEpuRXF4UkJIeklJZkRMWU9xQk9vcGRqZnhoVi0yQVZ2bTBzUXZKUGFqVDdjeldHTTNFU3NVd1Zuak85QXlOcjVUU0JHMHdtOG4tbFE?oc=5&quot;&gt;United News of Bangladesh&